{"schema_version":1,"category":"sleep","memes":[{"id":"m_b746bd0638c29d0d2381","title":"笨……笨蛋，怎么还不睡觉。哈？我怎么可能是关心你，别给我得意忘形了，总……总之快","description":"以傲娇口吻催促对方快点睡觉，嘴上否认关心却满脸害羞结巴，复合关心与别扭的语气；典型用于深夜聊天劝人休息、吐槽对方熬夜。","categories":["sleep"],"tags":["睡觉","困","晚安","休息","疲惫","催促睡觉","傲娇关心","否认在意","深夜劝睡","作息提醒","害羞结巴","笨蛋白痴","别得意忘形","熬夜吐槽","休息建议"],"moods":["sleep"],"animated":false,"image_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lsy112yhu/gpt-mimibox/main/public/images/m_b746bd0638c29d0d2381.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lsy112yhu/gpt-mimibox/main/public/thumbnails/m_b746bd0638c29d0d2381.webp","license":"CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0","sources":[{"pack":"official-001","url":"https://github.com/anka-afk/astrbot-meme-pack-official-01/blob/77f976826f058e566b7a84035774192871b6baac/memes/sleep/1739433751_1.jpg"}]},{"id":"m_65fe01e2d185660fe713","title":"老师从明天开始就要上班了是嘛？ 爱丽丝这边明天也要和小桃她们一起通宵玩游戏哦！","description":"开心兴奋地宣布自己要通宵玩游戏，语气俏皮又理直气壮，典型用于聊天中提到熬夜作息、通宵娱乐或对比对方要上班时自嘲式宣告不睡觉。","categories":["sleep"],"tags":["睡觉","困","晚安","休息","疲惫","通宵玩游戏","熬夜宣言","兴奋宣布","俏皮作息","通宵","熬夜玩乐","老师上班","爱丽丝","开心表情","通宵场景"],"moods":["sleep"],"animated":false,"image_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lsy112yhu/gpt-mimibox/main/public/images/m_65fe01e2d185660fe713.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lsy112yhu/gpt-mimibox/main/public/thumbnails/m_65fe01e2d185660fe713.webp","license":"CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0","sources":[{"pack":"official-001","url":"https://github.com/anka-afk/astrbot-meme-pack-official-01/blob/77f976826f058e566b7a84035774192871b6baac/memes/sleep/1739434473_1.jpg"}]},{"id":"m_2ba7db52e93cb2230827","title":"小猫躺了下去","description":"用趴在枕头上闭眼躺平的小猫形象，可爱又疲惫地宣告“我躺了”，表达累了要休息或直接开睡。常用于熬夜后、聊完准备下线，或半开玩笑宣布作息到此为止。","categories":["sleep"],"tags":["睡觉","困","晚安","休息","疲惫","躺下","疲劳","小猫","趴枕头","宣布下线","可爱疲惫","作息","躺平"],"moods":["sleep"],"animated":false,"image_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lsy112yhu/gpt-mimibox/main/public/images/m_2ba7db52e93cb2230827.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://raw.gi